# Round 24 reproducible-benchmark artefacts. The dataset itself
# (evals/bench/data/) is committed for reproducibility; the per-run
# results, durable SQLite ledger, and audit-chain mirror are not.
evals/bench/results/

# Round 27 vector-rerank intermediate exports (the .tvim + ONNX + tokenizer
# are committed; only the temporary `_bge_export/` / `_bge_tok_export/`
# scratch folders the offline indexer creates are excluded).
app/data/vectors/_bge_export/
app/data/vectors/_bge_tok_export/

